<Base title="Privacy Policy | DGTool" description="How DGTool handles your files, cookies, advertising and personal data.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="lead">Last updated: October 17, 2026</p>

  <h2>Your files stay on your device</h2>
  <p>DGTool's converters run inside your web browser. When you choose an image, it is processed on your own device and is not uploaded to our servers. We cannot see, store or share the files you convert.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not require an account and we do not ask for your name, email address or other personal details to use the tools. Like most websites, our hosting and security provider, Cloudflare, may automatically process technical information such as your IP address, browser type, requested pages and the date and time of each request. This is used to deliver the site, keep it secure and prevent abuse.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>The site itself does not set cookies to track you. Cloudflare may set strictly necessary cookies for security purposes. If we show advertising or add analytics (see below), those services may set their own cookies, and we will update this page when that happens.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>DGTool is free to use and may be supported by advertising. Advertising partners, such as Google, may use cookies or similar technologies to show ads and measure their performance, and may use information about your visits to this and other websites to show relevant ads. Where required by law, such as in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom, we will ask for your consent before personalised advertising cookies are used.</p>
  <p>You can manage personalised advertising through Google's Ads Settings, or opt out through the industry tools at youradchoices.com and aboutads.info. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>This site is hosted and delivered through Cloudflare. Web fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which means your browser may contact Google's servers to download the font files. These providers have their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights over personal data held about you, such as access, correction, deletion or objection to processing. Because we do not collect account information, we hold very little data about individual visitors. To make a request or ask a question, contact us using the details below.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>DGTool is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top of the page shows when it was last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:contact@dgtool.io">contact@dgtool.io</a>.</p>
</Base>
